---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Sources from '../../components/Sources.astro';
import BreweryMap from '../../components/BreweryMap.astro';
import NearbyList from '../../components/NearbyList.astro';
import { nearby, LANDMARKS } from '../../lib/geo';
const spot = LANDMARKS.fedexforum;
const items = await nearby(spot, 1.25);
const jsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'ItemList', name: 'Breweries near FedExForum',
  itemListElement: items.map((p, i) => ({ '@type': 'ListItem', position: i + 1, url: new URL(p.url, 'https://www.drinkmemphisbeer.com').href, name: p.name })),
};
---
<Base pageType="Article" title="Breweries Near FedExForum: Before a Grizzlies Game" description={`${items.length} Memphis brewery taprooms within walking distance of FedExForum, sorted by distance, with walking times.`} jsonLd={jsonLd}>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <nav class="label"><a href="/guides/">Guides</a> / Near FedExForum</nav>
    <h1 class="text-6xl mt-2">Breweries near FedExForum</h1>
    <div class="prose-dmb mt-4">
      <p>Grizzlies tip-off, a Tigers game or a concert at the Forum: there are {items.length} brewery taprooms within about a mile and a quarter, and the closest two are close enough to finish your pint after the doors open.</p>
      <p>Wiseacre's Downtown taproom on B.B. King and Ghost River's Beale Street spot are the pregame picks, a couple of minutes' walk. If you've got more time, MFS Brewing is a short walk south, and the Edge District and South Main breweries are a 15- to 20-minute walk, or a quick rideshare.</p>
      <p>Tap water, as always, is free at every one of them. It's still the best thing on the menu that doesn't come from a brewery.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-6"><BreweryMap pins={items} landmarks={[spot]} height="420px" /></div>
    <NearbyList items={items} from="FedExForum" />
    <p class="mt-8">Making a night of it? Take the <a href="/guides/downtown-brewery-crawl/">Downtown brewery crawl</a>, or see <a href="/guides/breweries-near-beale-street/">breweries near Beale Street</a>.</p>
    <Sources basedOn={items.map((it) => ({ title: it.name, url: `/breweries/${it.slug}/` }))} note="Map locations and walking distances are calculated from coordinates checked against OpenStreetMap and each brewery's listed address. Walking times assume about 20 minutes per mile." />
  </div>
</Base>
